    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day. Allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day. It's telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day for my pressure. Well, it's iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. I was on losartan before. I stopped taking it.",
