        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About... well, ten days. I've never really been one for hospitals. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know.",
